WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.320 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 19=

01:38.000 --> 01:38.719
(Commander,)

01:38.719 --> 01:39.599
(Li Mao has taken poison.)

01:39.599 --> 01:39.920
Commander.

01:39.920 --> 01:40.280
Commander.

01:41.799 --> 01:42.120
Commander.

01:42.120 --> 01:42.519
Commander.

01:53.599 --> 01:54.640
Who else did he see?

02:11.080 --> 02:13.319
The secrets of the capital

02:14.639 --> 02:18.439
aren't yours to uncover.

02:19.319 --> 02:21.199
Didn't you want to know

02:21.199 --> 02:23.919
who's really behind me?

02:26.560 --> 02:27.599
Now that

02:27.599 --> 02:29.039
I'm dying,

02:30.039 --> 02:31.919
you're done for, too.

02:33.479 --> 02:35.360
Investigating beyond your authority,

02:35.840 --> 02:37.840
driving an official to his death...

02:38.400 --> 02:40.240
Just wait.

02:41.400 --> 02:42.759
You'll be

02:43.120 --> 02:44.960
joining me soon enough.

02:57.319 --> 02:58.520
Do you really think

02:59.560 --> 03:00.680
a confession

03:07.159 --> 03:09.719
would've helped me more than your death?

03:50.160 --> 03:52.080
(Xie Residence)

03:52.080 --> 03:52.960
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

03:52.960 --> 03:53.759
Miss Xie.

03:54.319 --> 03:55.879
Congratulations, Miss Xie.

03:55.960 --> 03:56.879
I came

03:56.879 --> 03:58.360
especially to congratulate you.

04:02.560 --> 04:04.120
I'm almost embarrassed to say it.

04:04.240 --> 04:05.000
That house next door

04:05.000 --> 04:06.719
I showed you before

04:06.719 --> 04:08.360
turned out to belong
to a corrupt official.

04:08.560 --> 04:10.520
The authorities seized it today.

04:10.840 --> 04:12.479
Good thing fortune was on your side.

04:12.680 --> 04:14.719
Just look at the house
you bought instead.

04:14.840 --> 04:15.719
It's far more

04:15.879 --> 04:17.079
impressive than the one next door.

05:00.639 --> 05:01.600
Miss, look.

05:01.839 --> 05:03.519
Assistant Commander Zhao

05:03.519 --> 05:05.199
is leading men to raid the house
next door.

05:14.480 --> 05:16.000
When it comes to choosing a house,

05:16.079 --> 05:17.439
you need a good eye.

05:17.959 --> 05:19.759
And you've certainly got one, Miss Xie.

05:20.240 --> 05:21.199
Good thing

05:21.199 --> 05:22.720
you didn't choose the place next door.

05:22.920 --> 05:24.199
If you had,

05:24.199 --> 05:25.600
we'd be in real trouble now.

05:25.600 --> 05:26.480
Right, Miss Xie?

05:59.879 --> 06:00.560
They won't let us watch?

06:00.560 --> 06:01.639
This must be serious.

06:04.199 --> 06:05.600
What on earth did they do?

06:05.600 --> 06:06.120
Miss Xie,

06:06.399 --> 06:07.199
let's go back.

06:07.199 --> 06:09.120
We still have guests waiting inside.

06:40.360 --> 06:41.079
Miss Xie,

06:41.079 --> 06:41.879
it's getting chilly.

06:41.879 --> 06:42.839
Let's go inside.

06:47.360 --> 06:48.959
The storm brewing in the capital

06:50.720 --> 06:51.920
is finally coming.

07:01.360 --> 07:02.680
I'm innocent!

07:02.680 --> 07:03.079
Move!

07:03.079 --> 07:03.879
Commander Zhao!

07:03.879 --> 07:04.839
Please, spare us!

07:04.839 --> 07:05.319
Move!

07:05.399 --> 07:06.720
(Xu Residence)
I'm innocent!

07:06.720 --> 07:07.439
Master!

07:07.439 --> 07:07.920
Kneel!

07:08.680 --> 07:09.079
Kneel!

07:09.079 --> 07:10.199
Master!

07:10.199 --> 07:11.160
Commander Zhao!

07:11.439 --> 07:13.519
I'm innocent!

07:15.360 --> 07:17.360
I didn't do it!

07:17.800 --> 07:19.120
Commander Zhao!

07:19.720 --> 07:20.680
Commander Zhao!

07:20.759 --> 07:21.959
Commander Zhao!

07:22.079 --> 07:24.480
Please spare us, Commander Zhao!

07:24.759 --> 07:25.600
Commander Zhao!

07:25.959 --> 07:27.959
Please spare me!

07:28.199 --> 07:29.160
Master!

07:29.160 --> 07:31.399
Please spare me, Commander Zhao!

07:32.519 --> 07:33.680
Commander Zhao!

07:43.760 --> 07:47.480
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

07:51.520 --> 07:55.280
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

07:57.720 --> 08:02.040
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

08:02.560 --> 08:04.840
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

08:06.360 --> 08:11.000
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

08:14.280 --> 08:21.120
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye
will fill my eyes with tears♪

08:22.640 --> 08:28.720
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

08:29.360 --> 08:32.640
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

08:33.600 --> 08:37.360
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

08:38.080 --> 08:43.480
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

08:55.200 --> 08:58.960
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

09:03.120 --> 09:06.920
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

09:09.360 --> 09:13.640
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

09:14.040 --> 09:16.480
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

09:18.799 --> 09:20.679
(My fate is uncertain now.)

09:21.480 --> 09:22.960
(If I give in and see her,)

09:24.039 --> 09:26.679
(I'll only put her in harm's way.)

09:27.400 --> 09:30.919
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

09:30.919 --> 09:31.720
Commander Zhao!

09:50.320 --> 09:51.960
Master!

09:57.160 --> 10:04.080
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

10:04.639 --> 10:05.639
Go that way.

10:08.040 --> 10:09.000
Take the long way around.

10:09.000 --> 10:13.440
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

10:13.440 --> 10:18.120
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

10:23.080 --> 10:23.519
Move.

10:23.840 --> 10:24.320
Move.

10:27.720 --> 10:28.360
Move.

10:38.400 --> 10:41.440
(Yu Residence)

10:45.559 --> 10:46.320
Madam,

10:46.519 --> 10:47.960
I've confirmed it.

10:48.440 --> 10:49.440
The one who bought the house

10:49.440 --> 10:51.480
was indeed Ninth Young Lady Fu.

10:53.600 --> 10:54.960
Her?

10:57.519 --> 10:59.799
She's put down roots in the northwest
these past few years,

11:00.440 --> 11:02.240
and she's gotten much more capable.

11:02.840 --> 11:05.600
She knows exactly where to strike
to do the most damage.

11:06.519 --> 11:08.279
With her helping Zhao Ling,

11:10.480 --> 11:12.279
no wonder he gets things done
so quickly.

11:12.919 --> 11:14.240
I think

11:14.240 --> 11:15.559
it's better to mend old grudges

11:15.559 --> 11:16.399
than deepen them.

11:16.480 --> 11:19.320
Why not use Young Master Ji's
first-birthday banquet

11:19.320 --> 11:20.200
as an occasion to send an invitation

11:20.200 --> 11:22.080
and ask the Ninth Young Lady
to come talk?

11:23.519 --> 11:25.039
The Ninth Young Lady...

11:26.960 --> 11:27.519
Here.

11:30.039 --> 11:30.799
Young Madam.

11:32.840 --> 11:35.080
I heard Miss Xie moved
into her new home today

11:35.200 --> 11:36.679
and held quite
a housewarming celebration.

11:38.600 --> 11:39.840
Where did she settle?

11:40.360 --> 11:41.720
Shijia Hutong.

11:42.279 --> 11:44.000
The very house you had your eye on.

12:01.200 --> 12:02.720
She has no one to rely on,

12:04.440 --> 12:05.840
and only just arrived in the capital,

12:06.519 --> 12:08.919
yet she can already afford a house
beside the Imperial Academy.

12:09.600 --> 12:10.879
She can afford it,

12:11.279 --> 12:12.360
but I can't?

12:13.720 --> 12:14.679
But now,

12:14.679 --> 12:16.279
you're the Young Madam of the Yu family.

12:16.639 --> 12:17.639
In birth,

12:17.879 --> 12:18.799
education,

12:19.039 --> 12:19.799
and marriage,

12:20.279 --> 12:21.799
how could she possibly compare to you?

12:22.519 --> 12:23.519
She's nothing more than

12:23.519 --> 12:25.159
a woman who ran away with a man

12:25.320 --> 12:27.159
only to be abandoned by him.

12:27.639 --> 12:28.879
That mouth of yours...

12:35.440 --> 12:36.200
Young Madam.

12:36.200 --> 12:38.600
A visiting card came from the wife
of an Anzhou merchant.

12:38.679 --> 12:40.240
They say she's from Madam Yu's hometown.

12:40.240 --> 12:42.120
She sent me to let you know.

12:42.240 --> 12:43.799
She'd like you to receive them.

12:50.000 --> 12:52.320
I am Sun of the Wu family,
and this is my niece.

12:52.440 --> 12:53.879
Greetings, Young Madam Yu.

12:56.440 --> 12:59.039
I've long heard that you excel
at both poetry and painting.

12:59.200 --> 13:00.840
(Madam Wu, Salt Merchant from Anzhou)
After arriving in the capital,

13:00.960 --> 13:02.639
I realized that all the young ladies
in the city

13:02.799 --> 13:04.360
couldn't stop praising

13:04.440 --> 13:05.720
the literary gatherings you host.

13:06.000 --> 13:06.919
Madam Yu

13:06.919 --> 13:08.639
certainly gained
a wonderful daughter-in-law.

13:10.000 --> 13:11.200
You flatter me, Madam Wu.

13:11.679 --> 13:12.840
Our family business is modest.

13:12.960 --> 13:14.360
Besides salt,

13:14.360 --> 13:15.960
we also trade in medicinal herbs.

13:16.159 --> 13:17.279
By good fortune,

13:17.399 --> 13:19.360
we recently acquired these two
rare purple lingzhi mushrooms.

13:19.679 --> 13:21.600
They're for Madam Yu's health.

13:21.799 --> 13:23.279
I hope you'll accept them.

13:24.120 --> 13:25.320
That's very kind of you, Madam Wu.

13:25.840 --> 13:27.320
Mother told me to see

13:27.440 --> 13:29.200
that you were well received.

13:30.480 --> 13:31.960
And this is for you, Young Madam.

13:39.159 --> 13:40.120
What is it?

13:40.279 --> 13:41.519
Anzhou's waters

13:41.519 --> 13:43.320
produce some especially fine dried fish.

13:43.559 --> 13:44.600
Before I came,

13:44.600 --> 13:45.840
I had ten catties prepared

13:45.919 --> 13:47.519
for you to enjoy.

13:50.360 --> 13:51.080
Young Madam,

13:51.360 --> 13:52.799
this dried fish from Anzhou

13:52.960 --> 13:53.879
sells

13:54.000 --> 13:56.200
for dozens of taels per catty here
in the capital.

13:57.559 --> 13:59.440
You'll finish it
in just a couple of meals.

13:59.919 --> 14:01.039
No need to put it in storage.

14:06.480 --> 14:08.200
You certainly know how
to choose an unusual gift, Madam Wu.

14:09.039 --> 14:10.039
I hear

14:10.039 --> 14:10.919
other residences

14:10.919 --> 14:11.960
are a bit larger.

14:12.360 --> 14:13.840
But you've come a long way
to the capital.

14:14.080 --> 14:15.639
Why not stay here with us?

14:16.320 --> 14:17.679
Thank you, Young Madam.

14:17.840 --> 14:18.559
Mozhan.

14:19.159 --> 14:20.799
Have the maids prepare
everything properly.

14:21.440 --> 14:22.480
See that our guests are
well looked after.

14:22.639 --> 14:23.240
Yes.

14:40.320 --> 14:41.600
Are you wearing the orchid fragrance?

14:44.159 --> 14:45.200
Take off your veil.

14:46.120 --> 14:47.360
Lift your head. Let me see you.

14:54.039 --> 14:55.080
Young Madam told you to remove it.

14:55.080 --> 14:55.840
Do it now.

15:06.240 --> 15:11.240
(Miss Wu)

15:30.120 --> 15:31.799
Please wait here a moment.

15:31.799 --> 15:33.000
I'll have the carriage brought around

15:33.320 --> 15:35.480
to take you both to our residence
in the west of the city.

15:37.559 --> 15:38.440
Thank you.

15:45.919 --> 15:47.399
You were far too careless.

16:07.919 --> 16:09.159
Young Master loves orchids,

16:09.519 --> 16:10.759
and she just happens
to wear orchid fragrance.

16:11.240 --> 16:13.000
Clearly she was trying to seduce him.

16:14.159 --> 16:16.080
Good thing nothing escapes your eye,
Young Madam.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.080
Otherwise,

16:17.360 --> 16:18.759
she might actually have gotten away
with it.

16:20.000 --> 16:21.679
When I first married Young Master,

16:22.720 --> 16:24.159
I was about her age too.

16:25.159 --> 16:26.480
Sixteen or seventeen,

16:27.360 --> 16:28.559
young and pretty.

16:29.360 --> 16:30.960
What man wouldn't like that?

16:32.960 --> 16:34.519
Where did Madam Wu come from again?

16:35.279 --> 16:36.000
Anzhou.

16:37.320 --> 16:38.240
Anzhou...

16:39.360 --> 16:41.000
I've heard the salt merchants there

16:41.559 --> 16:43.279
buy young girls
from entertainment houses

16:44.120 --> 16:45.600
and train them specifically
to please men.

16:46.279 --> 16:47.399
They call them "trained courtesans."

16:49.320 --> 16:50.360
Tell me,

16:53.000 --> 16:54.039
why would she parade a girl like that

16:54.039 --> 16:55.519
right in front of Mother?

16:55.799 --> 16:57.600
And she dares call herself a young lady?

16:58.039 --> 16:59.480
What kind of "young lady" is she?

17:00.679 --> 17:02.679
Now even common merchants

17:03.200 --> 17:04.920
dare scheme against me.

17:05.839 --> 17:07.799
All because my birth family
has little influence

17:07.880 --> 17:08.960
and no powerful connections.

17:14.440 --> 17:15.319
Fine.

17:16.599 --> 17:18.000
For Ji's birthday banquet,

17:18.440 --> 17:19.799
I'm going to make it a grand affair.

17:21.079 --> 17:23.160
I want everyone to see

17:25.759 --> 17:28.279
if I'm the real Young Madam Yu.

17:34.840 --> 17:38.000
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

17:45.319 --> 17:46.000
Miss Xie.

17:46.319 --> 17:47.559
Someone from the Yu family brought this.

17:47.960 --> 17:48.759
They said it's

17:48.759 --> 17:50.359
an invitation to Young Master Ji's
first-birthday banquet.

17:51.079 --> 17:53.000
You just snatched that house out
from under Young Madam Yu,

17:53.480 --> 17:55.039
on top of all your old grudges.

17:55.720 --> 17:57.200
This is obviously a trap.

17:59.960 --> 18:00.840
(Invitation)

18:08.359 --> 18:10.839
The only way to find out how treacherous
the capital's social circles are

18:11.920 --> 18:14.200
and what the Yu family
is planning with this banquet

18:14.599 --> 18:16.599
is to go see for myself.

18:21.880 --> 18:25.120
(Invitation from the Yu Residence)

18:34.200 --> 18:36.240
Young Madam Yu is famously possessive.

18:36.400 --> 18:38.359
Even Mozhan, who was merely
somewhat pretty,

18:38.359 --> 18:40.079
was married off early.

18:40.079 --> 18:41.039
And you...

18:41.160 --> 18:42.759
you went and hit her right
where she's most sensitive.

18:43.720 --> 18:44.400
Madam,

18:44.480 --> 18:45.880
her waist has grown by half a cun.

18:52.119 --> 18:53.839
No dinner

18:53.839 --> 18:54.599
for the next two weeks.

18:56.680 --> 18:57.480
Yes.

18:58.319 --> 18:58.920
Madam,

18:59.039 --> 19:00.440
the Yu family sent an invitation

19:00.440 --> 19:01.880
(Invitation)
to Young Master Ji's birthday banquet.

19:08.839 --> 19:10.240
The Yu family's banquet

19:10.240 --> 19:11.440
will be full of powerful guests.

19:11.440 --> 19:12.759
You know exactly

19:12.759 --> 19:13.799
what's at stake.

19:14.079 --> 19:15.640
If you make another mistake,

19:16.279 --> 19:18.799
don't blame me for being harsh with you.

19:20.279 --> 19:20.960
I understand.

19:22.720 --> 19:24.799
Prepare two fine outfits for Miss Wu.

19:25.839 --> 19:26.440
Yes.

19:26.640 --> 19:27.519
Tomorrow,

19:27.799 --> 19:29.559
I'll find you a good household
to marry into.

19:32.160 --> 19:32.640
Let's go.

19:41.519 --> 19:42.880
Madam spends every day

19:42.880 --> 19:44.400
sending gifts to rich
and powerful families,

19:44.920 --> 19:46.759
yet she won't even let you eat properly

19:47.359 --> 19:49.160
or give you decent clothes.

19:50.319 --> 19:52.519
You've come here only to suffer.

19:55.599 --> 19:57.839
But she's right about one thing.

19:59.839 --> 20:01.839
If I can marry a good man,

20:03.319 --> 20:04.680
I can finally escape her.

20:05.480 --> 20:06.680
(Yu Residence)
Congratulations!

20:06.759 --> 20:07.559
Thank you, Madam.

20:07.559 --> 20:08.160
Please, come inside.

20:08.160 --> 20:09.039
Careful with that.

20:09.599 --> 20:10.000
Of course.

20:10.480 --> 20:11.480
Here. Put this away.

20:11.480 --> 20:12.039
This way, Madam.

20:13.039 --> 20:13.680
Please.

20:18.119 --> 20:18.960
This way, please.

20:19.200 --> 20:19.799
Okay.

20:21.640 --> 20:22.400
Sister.

20:23.000 --> 20:24.559
I could hear the firecrackers

20:24.559 --> 20:26.880
from two streets away.

20:27.200 --> 20:29.400
You've certainly made Ji's celebration

20:29.400 --> 20:31.240
both grand and auspicious.

20:31.359 --> 20:32.480
You flatter me.

20:34.400 --> 20:35.480
It's been quite some time.

20:35.799 --> 20:37.359
How have you been lately, Old Madam?

20:37.440 --> 20:39.000
I've been very well.

20:39.000 --> 20:40.119
(Old Madam Wei)

20:40.119 --> 20:42.000
My daughter-in-law often speaks of you.

20:42.079 --> 20:43.839
She says you handle everything

20:43.839 --> 20:45.400
with great care and elegance.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.640
Seeing this banquet today,

20:47.640 --> 20:49.480
I can see she was absolutely right.

20:49.480 --> 20:50.799
Thank you for your kind words,
Old Madam.

20:50.880 --> 20:51.880
Please, this way.

20:53.200 --> 20:54.160
Please.

21:02.279 --> 21:03.279
(Yu Residence)
How grand.

21:04.920 --> 21:06.039
It really is magnificent.

21:07.160 --> 21:08.160
Why is she here?

21:08.640 --> 21:09.599
Young Madam,

21:09.839 --> 21:11.759
Ms. Shu personally went to Shijia Hutong

21:11.759 --> 21:12.960
to deliver the invitation.

21:15.039 --> 21:16.440
This is my son's first-birthday banquet.

21:17.119 --> 21:18.400
Why invite her?

21:22.599 --> 21:24.119
Are Madam Wu

21:24.119 --> 21:25.079
and Miss Wu

21:25.079 --> 21:25.920
from Anzhou

21:26.519 --> 21:27.839
coming too?

21:28.240 --> 21:28.920
Yes.

21:39.759 --> 21:40.920
Of all days, the palace banquet

21:40.920 --> 21:42.799
falls on the Young Master Ji's
first birthday.

21:42.799 --> 21:44.000
And we can't very well ask
to be excused.

21:48.920 --> 21:49.759
This way, please.

22:05.559 --> 22:06.400
She's here.

22:14.559 --> 22:16.759
Who's in charge of the cooking today?

22:17.359 --> 22:18.440
From Cuixi House.

22:20.160 --> 22:21.119
Add a dish of sesame flatbread.

22:23.079 --> 22:23.599
Yes.

22:37.640 --> 22:38.720
What's this?

22:38.839 --> 22:40.200
Young Master arranged it.

22:43.720 --> 22:44.720
Ladies,

22:45.359 --> 22:47.440
my husband once went
on an inspection tour in the northwest.

22:47.559 --> 22:48.559
When he returned to the capital,

22:48.559 --> 22:49.799
he brought back some local specialties

22:49.799 --> 22:50.720
for me to try.

22:52.000 --> 22:53.640
I especially liked
this sesame flatbread.

22:54.039 --> 22:55.319
He's always been thoughtful,

22:55.880 --> 22:56.960
so he remembered.

22:58.079 --> 23:00.000
Young Lord Yu is so considerate.

23:00.000 --> 23:02.119
How enviable.

23:02.279 --> 23:03.559
Then let's have a taste.

23:03.559 --> 23:04.240
Yes.

23:11.920 --> 23:13.920
I hear Commander Zhao has been back
in the capital for some time

23:14.240 --> 23:15.599
and hasn't even come to see you.

23:15.799 --> 23:17.000
Could it be that

23:17.000 --> 23:18.240
now that he's risen in rank,

23:18.720 --> 23:21.000
he's forgotten the woman
who stood by him through hardship?

23:22.640 --> 23:24.200
We have
many distinguished ladies here today,

23:24.400 --> 23:26.359
all from prominent households.

23:26.759 --> 23:28.200
Shall I make some introductions

23:28.440 --> 23:29.599
and help you find a husband,

23:30.079 --> 23:31.480
so you don't waste your youth?

23:31.920 --> 23:32.839
Watch

23:32.839 --> 23:34.279
your mouth! I...

23:39.599 --> 23:40.880
Have you noticed

23:41.160 --> 23:42.240
that right now,

23:42.440 --> 23:43.160
you sound remarkably like

23:43.160 --> 23:44.759
someone we both know?

23:52.039 --> 23:53.799
If you were truly happy with your life,

23:54.720 --> 23:56.319
why come flaunting it in front of me

23:56.319 --> 23:57.960
like some proud rooster?

24:02.440 --> 24:03.799
I wouldn't call it flaunting.

24:04.400 --> 24:05.960
I'm simply living an ordinary life.

24:05.960 --> 24:07.480
I didn't realize that, in your eyes,

24:07.799 --> 24:09.119
even that counted as showing off.

24:12.079 --> 24:14.119
If you're genuinely happy,

24:14.400 --> 24:16.160
after all our years as close friends,

24:16.720 --> 24:18.319
of course I'd be happy for you.

24:19.079 --> 24:20.839
But sometimes, when I think of the past,

24:21.200 --> 24:23.119
I can't help feeling it's a shame.

24:23.880 --> 24:25.759
You, Fan Yake,

24:27.000 --> 24:29.039
once became famous throughout Huaying

24:29.039 --> 24:31.400
with a single painting
of narcissus flowers.

24:38.279 --> 24:40.680
But now, on your teacup...

24:42.880 --> 24:44.119
are those still narcissus flowers?

24:48.240 --> 24:48.839
Change them.

24:49.119 --> 24:50.880
Madam Yu specifically ordered it.

24:51.440 --> 24:52.240
You may go.

24:53.880 --> 24:54.599
Young Madam,

24:55.039 --> 24:56.480
everyone in the capital knows

24:56.640 --> 24:58.359
Young Master loves orchids most.

24:58.720 --> 25:00.039
Madam Yu arranged this

25:00.319 --> 25:01.400
because she cares for you.

25:05.839 --> 25:07.400
Go fetch Madam Wu.

25:08.519 --> 25:10.119
The real show is about to begin.

25:10.880 --> 25:11.519
Yes.

25:15.559 --> 25:17.680
This young lady comes
from my mother-in-law's hometown.

25:18.160 --> 25:19.000
Her surname is Wu.

25:20.839 --> 25:23.279
That Huzhou silk dress is lovely.

25:23.279 --> 25:25.440
It reminds me of something
from years ago.

25:26.039 --> 25:26.759
Back then,

25:26.759 --> 25:28.240
when we were in Yongning,

25:28.759 --> 25:30.480
Miss Xie's fiance

25:30.480 --> 25:31.640
didn't want anyone else

25:31.640 --> 25:33.200
wearing the same fabric as her,

25:33.799 --> 25:35.440
so he bought up

25:35.440 --> 25:37.079
every bolt of Huzhou silk in the city.

25:37.279 --> 25:38.559
He spared no expense.

25:38.680 --> 25:40.960
He cherished her above all else.

25:41.359 --> 25:42.680
There's no comparison.

25:42.960 --> 25:44.480
Miss Xie's fiance

25:44.480 --> 25:46.319
is the renowned Commander Zhao.

25:46.519 --> 25:47.759
Their social standing

25:48.039 --> 25:49.400
is worlds apart.

25:50.160 --> 25:52.000
Commander Zhao, the one
who drove Li Mao to his death?

25:52.240 --> 25:53.160
I thought

25:53.240 --> 25:54.759
he wasn't engaged.

25:55.200 --> 25:56.400
I heard

25:56.400 --> 25:58.160
that Miss Xie's so-called fiance

25:58.160 --> 26:00.200
no longer acknowledges their engagement.

26:00.519 --> 26:02.240
Miss Xie may be highborn,

26:02.559 --> 26:04.160
but Miss Wu here

26:04.279 --> 26:06.759
was graciously given a chance
by Young Madam to display her talent

26:06.759 --> 26:08.519
by painting at today's banquet

26:08.640 --> 26:10.319
and capturing the celebration.

26:12.359 --> 26:13.759
But in this painting,

26:14.920 --> 26:16.400
why don't I see Miss Xie?

26:23.079 --> 26:23.839
How dare you.

26:25.359 --> 26:26.559
Madam,

26:26.960 --> 26:28.200
the paper is limited in size.

26:28.400 --> 26:30.079
To capture the elegance

26:30.079 --> 26:31.119
of all the distinguished ladies here,

26:31.440 --> 26:32.240
I had no choice

26:34.599 --> 26:36.079
but to leave a few people out.

26:37.880 --> 26:39.119
In that case,

26:40.599 --> 26:42.000
use a larger sheet

26:42.000 --> 26:43.079
and paint it again.

26:45.519 --> 26:46.759
Young Madam, please understand.

26:47.240 --> 26:48.720
For today's painting

26:48.720 --> 26:50.960
to be worthy of the ladies
gathered here,

26:51.319 --> 26:53.000
I specifically chose the rarest

26:53.000 --> 26:54.079
Bailu Xuan paper.

26:55.079 --> 26:56.240
This paper is extremely valuable,

26:56.480 --> 26:58.039
and this is already
the largest sheet available.

26:58.039 --> 26:58.920
Any other sheet

26:58.920 --> 27:00.319
would only be smaller.

27:01.119 --> 27:03.160
Unfortunately, Miss Wu's skill
is still lacking,

27:03.400 --> 27:04.559
so today's painting

27:05.079 --> 27:06.680
will simply have to leave
a few people out.

27:09.160 --> 27:10.039
Everyone here

27:10.039 --> 27:11.440
is an honored guest of the Yu family.

27:11.839 --> 27:12.960
How could our neighboring ladies

27:13.079 --> 27:14.279
possibly be left out?

27:14.799 --> 27:16.480
Ladies holding imperial titles

27:16.839 --> 27:18.079
and the mistresses
of the great households

27:18.240 --> 27:19.039
must, of course,

27:19.039 --> 27:20.160
all be included.

27:21.440 --> 27:22.680
With Li Mao dead,

27:23.319 --> 27:25.000
Commander Zhao
will be in danger himself.

27:26.559 --> 27:27.599
In this picture,

27:29.079 --> 27:30.279
there is no place for you.

27:33.160 --> 27:34.759
I hope you'll forgive us, Miss Xie.

27:34.839 --> 27:37.480
We can have Miss Wu
paint your portrait another day.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.559
A painting depends on

27:39.559 --> 27:41.000
placement and emphasis.

27:41.519 --> 27:43.640
Adding or removing a figure
is hardly difficult.

27:44.599 --> 27:45.839
With your skill,

27:45.839 --> 27:46.799
surely you know that.

27:47.200 --> 27:48.519
If you know it,
yet claim you can't do it,

27:48.519 --> 27:49.480
then I imagine

27:49.480 --> 27:50.759
there's another reason.

27:52.119 --> 27:54.319
The Yu family invited me here today,

27:54.880 --> 27:56.519
which makes me your guest.

27:57.359 --> 27:58.920
Yet now you coerce others

27:59.119 --> 28:00.799
to humiliate a guest in public.

28:01.559 --> 28:02.640
Young Madam Yu,

28:02.920 --> 28:04.559
is this how your family
treats its guests?

28:11.160 --> 28:12.640
Poor painting skills are one thing,

28:13.200 --> 28:14.759
but ranking people by status

28:14.759 --> 28:16.039
and comparing their husbands' offices?

28:16.519 --> 28:17.480
How improper.

28:17.759 --> 28:19.440
I was thoughtless.

28:19.519 --> 28:20.640
Please forgive me, Young Madam.

28:22.160 --> 28:23.960
I'll redo the composition

28:24.880 --> 28:26.119
and include

28:26.440 --> 28:27.359
all the ladies present.

28:29.079 --> 28:29.880
Go on, then.

28:32.079 --> 28:32.839
Zhao Ling

28:32.839 --> 28:33.960
exceeded his authority

28:33.960 --> 28:34.880
and overstepped the court's laws.

28:35.000 --> 28:36.200
Under the law,

28:36.200 --> 28:37.480
he should be dismissed and investigated.

28:40.160 --> 28:41.079
Summon Zhao Ling.

28:41.319 --> 28:43.400
Summon Zhao Ling!

28:51.960 --> 28:52.920
Your Majesty,

28:53.759 --> 28:55.200
I resorted to extraordinary measures

28:55.400 --> 28:56.480
and used torture
to extract a confession.

28:57.039 --> 28:58.079
I know I overstepped my authority.

29:00.880 --> 29:02.440
(Grand Secretary Tian,
Grand Academician of Wenhua Hall)

29:04.640 --> 29:05.319
However,

29:05.960 --> 29:07.119
the convicted official Li Mao

29:07.440 --> 29:08.599
repented on his deathbed

29:10.880 --> 29:12.039
and confessed to his crimes.

29:12.559 --> 29:15.079
(Memorial: Gandu Military Embezzlement)
He also wrote down his co-conspirators.

29:16.480 --> 29:18.119
I await Your Majesty's judgment.

29:18.240 --> 29:19.279
Li Mao confessed?

29:19.599 --> 29:21.160
If he did, why would he kill himself?

29:21.160 --> 29:22.279
Exactly.

29:46.599 --> 29:48.240
There is something you don't know.

29:49.279 --> 29:50.240
Zhao Ling

29:52.279 --> 29:53.880
received a secret edict from me.

29:54.319 --> 29:55.839
That is why he came to the capital.

29:56.880 --> 29:58.920
As for the charge that he investigated
beyond his authority,

29:59.720 --> 30:00.880
you have

30:02.119 --> 30:03.039
wrongly accused him.

30:08.519 --> 30:10.319
I know you were eager to solve the case

30:10.599 --> 30:12.119
and acted before reporting
to the Ministry of Justice.

30:13.519 --> 30:15.400
But the court has laws and procedures.

30:15.599 --> 30:17.279
If I hadn't protected you today,

30:17.279 --> 30:18.720
what would you have done?

30:23.920 --> 30:24.720
I deserve death.

30:25.200 --> 30:26.480
Your Majesty protected me today,

30:27.759 --> 30:28.960
just as you did in Yongning

30:29.920 --> 30:31.720
when you forgave me
for concealing my identity.

30:32.279 --> 30:32.880
I am

30:33.680 --> 30:34.680
deeply grateful
for Your Majesty's mercy.

30:36.599 --> 30:38.079
You've changed greatly

30:38.079 --> 30:39.240
from the man you were a few years ago.

30:40.559 --> 30:43.160
I intend to thoroughly investigate
corruption in the salt administration.

30:43.160 --> 30:44.759
If Li Mao's confession

30:44.759 --> 30:46.039
can serve as a warning,

30:46.160 --> 30:47.480
perhaps those corrupt officials

30:47.480 --> 30:48.759
will learn to rein themselves in.

30:49.480 --> 30:50.240
However,

30:50.440 --> 30:51.559
this assignment

30:51.880 --> 30:52.880
will make you enemies.

30:53.200 --> 30:53.920
If you fail,

30:54.119 --> 30:55.480
it could cost you your head.

30:55.920 --> 30:56.640
Will you take it?

30:58.839 --> 31:00.400
I will give it everything I have

31:00.640 --> 31:01.680
and not fail Your Majesty's trust.

31:02.279 --> 31:02.799
Good.

31:03.359 --> 31:04.240
Then remember this.

31:04.559 --> 31:06.119
You returned to the capital
by imperial command

31:06.319 --> 31:07.599
with special authority to make arrests.

31:12.799 --> 31:13.839
Thank you, Your Majesty.

31:15.520 --> 31:16.960
(Yu Residence)

31:16.960 --> 31:18.000
The auspicious hour has arrived.

31:18.279 --> 31:19.799
Let the first-birthday
choosing ceremony begin.

31:25.880 --> 31:27.400
In other families,

31:27.400 --> 31:28.759
the child's mother usually holds him
for the ceremony.

31:29.200 --> 31:30.160
So why, in the Yu family,

31:30.160 --> 31:31.640
is Madam Yu presiding?

31:32.119 --> 31:33.759
You think Young Madam Yu
doesn't want to?

31:33.960 --> 31:34.880
In this family,

31:34.880 --> 31:36.400
Madam Yu is still the one in charge.

31:36.480 --> 31:38.359
She could bear ten children
and it wouldn't matter.

31:38.440 --> 31:39.319
There can only be

31:39.319 --> 31:40.480
one true matriarch of the house.

31:41.160 --> 31:43.359
Today is my grandson Ji's
first birthday.

31:43.680 --> 31:46.279
Thank you all for joining us
to celebrate.

31:46.559 --> 31:48.240
If anything has been lacking
in our hospitality,

31:48.599 --> 31:49.839
I hope you'll forgive us.

31:50.960 --> 31:52.599
Just look at the boy.

31:52.720 --> 31:54.519
That high nose, those big eyes...

31:54.519 --> 31:55.440
he looks

31:55.440 --> 31:57.319
just like Madam Yu.

31:57.400 --> 31:58.440
No wonder they say

31:58.440 --> 31:59.759
grandparents and grandchildren
share a special bond.

32:00.000 --> 32:02.079
The young master
takes after his grandmother,

32:02.279 --> 32:02.920
so one day

32:02.920 --> 32:04.400
he'll surely be especially devoted
to her.

32:05.119 --> 32:06.640
Indeed.

32:07.680 --> 32:08.799
How adorable.

32:09.240 --> 32:10.359
Now let's see

32:10.359 --> 32:12.200
what future little Ji chooses
for himself.

32:13.319 --> 32:14.920
First, the longevity lock.

32:14.920 --> 32:15.759
Good health,

32:15.759 --> 32:16.559
long life,

32:16.559 --> 32:17.720
and lasting blessings.

32:22.920 --> 32:24.680
Second, the golden spoon.

32:25.079 --> 32:27.519
A lifetime of wealth and honor.

32:31.279 --> 32:32.880
Third, the calligraphy brush.

32:32.880 --> 32:34.319
Intelligence and a love of learning,

32:34.319 --> 32:35.519
with a bright future ahead.

32:35.759 --> 32:38.000
Congratulations, Madam Yu.

32:38.000 --> 32:39.440
Congratulations to the Yu family.

32:39.440 --> 32:42.039
That boy is clearly destined
to carry on the family legacy.

32:42.039 --> 32:43.559
He'll surely make something of himself.

32:46.160 --> 32:46.880
Reward them.

32:51.319 --> 32:52.880
(Jiuxiao Banquet Hall)
When I was still Crown Prince,

32:53.200 --> 32:55.240
you enlisted with my letter
of introduction.

32:56.000 --> 32:57.079
Over the past five years,

32:57.240 --> 32:58.839
you've led your troops
to victory time and again

32:59.400 --> 33:00.400
and handled

33:00.720 --> 33:02.160
this case exceptionally well.

33:02.640 --> 33:03.519
It seems

33:04.279 --> 33:05.799
I was right about you.

33:07.440 --> 33:08.359
Zhao Ling,

33:09.160 --> 33:09.880
you deserve a reward.

33:10.279 --> 33:12.960
Senior fourth-rank Assistant Commander
of the Capital Guard.

33:13.720 --> 33:14.519
Do you like it?

33:16.160 --> 33:17.079
Thank you, Your Majesty.

33:17.960 --> 33:18.720
Rise.

33:19.160 --> 33:20.640
He's been promoted to fourth-rank?

33:20.640 --> 33:22.000
Yes. That was fast.

33:22.279 --> 33:23.359
Zhao,

33:24.119 --> 33:25.160
do you have a courtesy name?

33:26.079 --> 33:26.880
Your Majesty,

33:27.119 --> 33:28.279
my parents died when I was young,

33:28.400 --> 33:29.279
so I was never given one.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.519
I have little learning,

33:36.240 --> 33:37.519
so I ask Your Majesty
to bestow one upon me.

33:38.559 --> 33:41.440
You certainly know how
to seize an opportunity.

33:46.559 --> 33:48.000
Huchen.

33:53.000 --> 33:54.039
How do you like

33:54.839 --> 33:55.720
that courtesy name?

33:56.079 --> 33:56.920
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34:00.039 --> 34:01.480
So when do we get to celebrate

34:01.480 --> 34:03.079
your marriage to Miss Xie?

34:05.400 --> 34:06.240
She is

34:07.480 --> 34:09.519
at a banquet at the Yu Residence
right now.

34:12.079 --> 34:14.039
Then go with Minister Yu

34:14.199 --> 34:15.800
and bring your sweetheart home.

34:17.719 --> 34:18.239
Yes.

34:26.719 --> 34:28.079
Come, sit. Please.

34:28.840 --> 34:30.800
It's been so long
since we've all been together.

34:30.800 --> 34:31.440
Sit here.

34:31.440 --> 34:32.360
Forgive my poor hospitality.

34:32.679 --> 34:33.880
Please make yourselves at home.

34:34.039 --> 34:35.239
I'll sit right beside you.

34:35.840 --> 34:37.280
We can finally catch up properly today.

34:37.280 --> 34:38.239
Exactly.

34:38.239 --> 34:39.440
Then let me offer a few toasts first.

34:39.559 --> 34:40.119
Here.

34:42.320 --> 34:43.679
No need to be so formal with me.

34:43.679 --> 34:44.880
So graceful and elegant.

34:46.840 --> 34:48.519
A true lady of good breeding.

34:48.519 --> 34:50.000
What were you thinking?

34:50.000 --> 34:51.880
Miss Xie is an honored guest
I personally invited.

34:51.880 --> 34:53.199
Why was she seated at the last table?

34:53.960 --> 34:55.039
Mother,

34:55.280 --> 34:57.440
Mozhan arranged the seating
according to precedent.

34:58.039 --> 34:59.559
I should have thought it
through more carefully.

34:59.559 --> 35:00.400
Ridiculous.

35:07.480 --> 35:08.440
Miss Xie.

35:10.079 --> 35:10.559
Come.

35:10.840 --> 35:12.199
Sit beside me.

35:14.480 --> 35:15.880
We haven't seen each other in years.

35:16.000 --> 35:17.760
We have so much to catch up on.

35:18.239 --> 35:18.760
Come.

35:26.599 --> 35:27.239
Madam Yu,

35:27.719 --> 35:29.280
I'm afraid such an honor is more
than I deserve.

35:29.920 --> 35:30.679
Have a seat.

35:42.199 --> 35:44.079
Miss Xie, perhaps you haven't heard.

35:44.480 --> 35:46.119
At the palace banquet just now,

35:46.119 --> 35:48.639
His Majesty bestowed the courtesy name
Huchen upon Commander Zhao

35:48.639 --> 35:49.639
and granted him special permission

35:49.639 --> 35:50.840
to remain in the capital as an official.

35:51.000 --> 35:52.679
From a regional post to the capital,

35:52.679 --> 35:54.280
he's certainly risen fast.

35:54.639 --> 35:55.440
From now on,

35:55.440 --> 35:57.119
you'll both be staying in the capital.

35:57.239 --> 35:59.760
His Majesty even mentioned
your marriage just now.

36:00.320 --> 36:01.880
Come sit closer

36:01.880 --> 36:03.119
and tell me all about it.

36:03.519 --> 36:04.800
Thank you for telling me, Madam.

36:05.079 --> 36:06.280
I'm deeply grateful
for His Majesty's favor.

36:07.039 --> 36:09.039
Then congratulations
are certainly in order.

36:09.119 --> 36:11.480
Looks like you backed the right man.

36:11.760 --> 36:13.320
Miss Xie and Commander Zhao

36:13.320 --> 36:14.760
truly are devoted to each other.

36:15.519 --> 36:15.960
Here.

36:16.320 --> 36:17.800
A toast to Miss Xie.

36:17.960 --> 36:19.199
Congratulations!

36:19.199 --> 36:20.079
Congratulations!

36:41.159 --> 36:42.239
Who would've thought

36:42.920 --> 36:44.239
things would turn around so suddenly?

36:44.519 --> 36:45.840
Miss Xie

36:46.199 --> 36:47.440
is clearly no ordinary woman.

36:59.719 --> 37:00.719
Five years ago,

37:01.039 --> 37:01.960
you told me

37:02.639 --> 37:04.199
I could spend ten years,

37:05.280 --> 37:06.760
even decades,

37:07.719 --> 37:10.039
to reach your father's level.

37:11.599 --> 37:13.639
So how far have I climbed now?

37:16.880 --> 37:18.239
Am I high enough

37:19.000 --> 37:20.159
to sit

37:20.280 --> 37:21.760
at the same table as your father?

37:23.960 --> 37:25.360
I'd rather know

37:26.719 --> 37:29.360
whether she likes the man you've become.

37:31.760 --> 37:32.760
Have the two of you

37:33.679 --> 37:35.039
set a wedding date yet?

37:38.679 --> 37:40.920
That's none of your concern.

38:00.280 --> 38:02.280
I was occupied in the rear rooms
just now

38:03.199 --> 38:05.440
and didn't know my daughter-in-law
had offended you in the main hall.

38:06.519 --> 38:08.079
I failed to keep her in line.

38:08.400 --> 38:10.159
Please forgive us, Miss Xie.

38:10.599 --> 38:11.760
I hope this

38:12.119 --> 38:14.159
won't damage the bond
we've shared all these years.

38:14.480 --> 38:16.679
I took a liking to you back in Huaying,

38:17.320 --> 38:18.800
and it seems fate has brought us
together again.

38:19.119 --> 38:20.800
Why don't we put
our age difference aside

38:20.800 --> 38:22.000
and just be friends?

38:22.159 --> 38:24.039
You and Zhao Ling are new
to the capital.

38:24.519 --> 38:26.400
It would be good for us to look out
for one another.

38:32.400 --> 38:33.559
Surely you jest, Madam.

38:34.920 --> 38:35.960
Yake and I

38:35.960 --> 38:37.280
grew up together.

38:37.840 --> 38:39.920
If I were to treat her mother-in-law
as my peer,

38:40.760 --> 38:41.920
where would that

38:42.039 --> 38:43.239
leave Yake?

38:46.239 --> 38:47.960
It was my daughter-in-law

38:48.119 --> 38:49.760
who hurt you back then.

38:51.280 --> 38:52.840
Was Yake the only one who hurt me?

38:58.639 --> 39:00.079
When Young Lord Yu

39:00.079 --> 39:01.480
came to Ganlin on his inspection,

39:01.480 --> 39:03.239
the matter of those
four written confessions

39:03.679 --> 39:05.039
was settled once and for all.

39:08.960 --> 39:10.320
Four?

39:15.519 --> 39:16.840
Allow me one word of advice today

39:17.000 --> 39:18.960
to Commander Zhao.

39:19.039 --> 39:21.400
Be more careful from now on.

39:22.320 --> 39:23.920
There's more to the capital

39:24.360 --> 39:25.519
than meets the eye.

39:26.000 --> 39:27.760
Don't let one impulsive move

39:27.760 --> 39:29.199
cost you everything you've built.

39:31.079 --> 39:31.760
Please.

39:34.960 --> 39:35.960
(May Virtue and Grace Endure)

39:35.960 --> 39:36.519
Let's go.

39:38.440 --> 39:39.519
Good thing we brought umbrellas.

39:40.079 --> 39:41.920
Look how hard it's raining.

39:44.360 --> 39:45.760
Look. Who's that over there?

39:47.159 --> 39:47.880
Who?

40:08.320 --> 40:13.760
♪Once a bird among the clouds,
now fallen into the mortal world♪

40:13.760 --> 40:20.640
♪Inviting frost to my temples,
veiling the face of bygone days♪

40:20.640 --> 40:26.720
♪With a feather in my beak, I brave
the storm away every false accusation♪

40:26.720 --> 40:33.560
♪May all common folk share one roof,
every lantern rest in peace♪

40:33.560 --> 40:35.960
♪Let this humble name carry me♪

40:35.960 --> 40:37.000
It's Commander Zhao.

40:38.840 --> 40:45.841
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

40:45.880 --> 40:48.440
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

40:48.440 --> 40:51.000
♪In exchange for boundless skies♪

40:52.120 --> 40:54.640
(Next Episode)

40:55.519 --> 40:56.920
(The struggle for power at court)

40:57.400 --> 40:58.880
(is like rowing against the current.)

40:59.519 --> 41:00.719
(If you don't move forward,
you fall behind.)

41:01.480 --> 41:03.000
(There's a staircase before me.)

41:03.760 --> 41:05.519
(I have no choice but to keep climbing,)

41:06.280 --> 41:07.360
(all the way to the top.)

41:07.920 --> 41:09.440
Only by standing high enough

41:09.719 --> 41:11.840
can I truly protect us

41:12.599 --> 41:14.719
from the storm of arrows aimed our way.

41:15.320 --> 41:17.039
Since it's come to this,

41:17.159 --> 41:18.559
from now on, our two families

41:19.239 --> 41:21.119
will fight until one of us falls.

41:21.320 --> 41:22.639
I've set the stage for you.

41:23.239 --> 41:24.960
From here on out, you'll have

41:25.639 --> 41:26.760
plenty of people willing
to do the dirty work.

41:39.480 --> 41:43.800
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

41:47.400 --> 41:51.760
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

41:53.880 --> 41:58.520
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

41:58.760 --> 42:01.560
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

42:02.720 --> 42:07.360
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

42:10.560 --> 42:17.400
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

42:18.280 --> 42:24.800
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

42:25.760 --> 42:29.200
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

42:29.720 --> 42:33.920
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:34.200 --> 42:39.880
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

42:52.000 --> 42:55.880
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

42:59.800 --> 43:03.800
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

43:05.520 --> 43:10.200
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

43:10.520 --> 43:13.200
♪Kept close within my heart♪

43:14.280 --> 43:19.120
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

43:22.640 --> 43:29.560
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

43:30.440 --> 43:36.920
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

43:37.800 --> 43:41.320
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

43:41.760 --> 43:46.120
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

43:46.320 --> 43:52.040
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
